[Trigger]
Name	openingRound
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	A vaulted cavern holds four long lanes with old boulder traps in them, and stone-faced guards stand in the lanes like skittles as soon as the earth plugs are opened. Dig into each lane and let the boulders roll.
Action	objective	1	Knock down all ten standing guards before time runs out.
Action	timelimit	540
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
